WEBVTT

00:00:02.750 --> 00:00:08.708
You’re bringing the right people into one
room. What do you want them to remember

00:00:08.708 --> 00:00:09.917
when they leave?

00:00:10.208 --> 00:00:18.000
VNV Events produces conferences, launches,
and client gatherings in South Florida.

00:00:18.292 --> 00:00:25.208
We shape the schedule, coordinate the venue
and vendors, and plan the audiovisual

00:00:25.208 --> 00:00:27.333
production and guest experience.

00:00:27.625 --> 00:00:33.917
On event day, our team runs the production
so yours can focus on the people you

00:00:33.917 --> 00:00:34.292
invited.

00:00:34.583 --> 00:00:40.750
Tell us who’s coming and what you want the
event to accomplish. We’ll build the

00:00:40.750 --> 00:00:42.000
production around that.
